          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>At Backyard Nests, we believe the backyard is more than extra square footage , it is where families reconnect, friends linger longer, and the best memories are made without schedules. It's where birthdays stretch into warm evenings, championship games are celebrated under open skies, and quiet mornings begin with intention. We exist to help homeowners transform ordinary outdoor spaces into meaningful destinations that reflect the quality and care they bring to the rest of their home.</p>"
