          }
        },
        "richtext_HFdEcx": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Backyard Nests was born out of a simple observation: the care and quality we put into our indoor spaces often stops at the back door.</p><p>My name is Jamieson, and my professional background is in digital product leadership and luxury hospitality. I've spent my career building seamless digital experiences and managing high-touch service environments. I started Backyard Nests to bring those same standards to the outdoor industry.</p><p>I believe that buying a high-ticket item like a luxury pergola or a professional game table should be a transparent and supportive process. We use a product management mindset to ensure our technical data is accurate and our supplier relationships are strong. Our goal is to provide a curated digital showroom where quality is guaranteed and the customer experience is handled with the attention to detail it deserves.</p>"
