        "richtext_j6fydK": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>We don’t simply sell products, we curate a complete lifestyle ecosystem designed for connection, comfort, and performance. From architectural structures that define your space, to elevated lounging, outdoor culinary experiences, immersive entertainment, and active backyard play, every piece in our collection is selected for its durability, sophistication, and ability to elevate how you live. Our focus is simple: professional-grade quality that feels refined enough to complement luxury residential design.</p>"
